properties.sourceSummary:
The following changes are made to introduce support L1-SINR measurement report mapping: 
SS-SINR measurement mapping table for L3 reporting is extended to support L1-SINR mapping for SS-SINR and CSI-SINR;
Differential SINR mapping table for L1 reporting is introduced.

